{"ref":"character:julius-belmont","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Julius Belmont is a playable character from the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. His starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Vanitas_Whip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:vanitas-whip"}," ",{"t":"Vanitas Whip","r":"weapon:vanitas-whip"},". He is also eligible to pick ",{"i":"Sprite-Morning_Star.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:morning-star"}," ",{"t":"Morning Star","r":"weapon:morning-star"}," as starting weapon via ",{"i":"Sprite-Mindbender.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:mindbender"}," ",{"t":"skin selection","r":"relic:mindbender"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["31 October 2024 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Julius"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_JULIUS"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_Julius_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Vanitas_Whip.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:vanitas-whip"}," ",{"t":"Vanitas Whip","r":"weapon:vanitas-whip"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Find and open the second coffin in Ode to Castlevania."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Coffin","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Ode_to_Castlevania-Evelyn_Lark.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Heart of Fire - Vampire Survivors\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["180"]]},{"label":"Might","cells":[["+40%"]]},{"label":"Revival","cells":[["+1"]]},{"label":"Banish","cells":[["+10"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Julius can be unlocked by finding and opening the second coffin in Ode to Castlevania, located in a hidden room inside the library."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Julius can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"omniavanitas\"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Defeating ",{"i":"Sprite-Gergoth.png","w":24,"h":24}," Gergoth, located at the downstairs of middle building below the library, just above the ",{"i":"Sprite-Capra_Gate.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:capra-gate"}," ",{"t":"Capra Gate","r":"relic:capra-gate"},", as Julius will unlock ",{"i":"Sprite-Soma_Cruz.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"character:soma-cruz"}," ",{"t":"Soma Cruz","r":"character:soma-cruz"}," as a playable character."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Julius starts with +80 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", +40% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},", +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Revival.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:revival"}," ",{"t":"Revival","r":"powerup:revival"},", and +10 ",{"i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banish","r":"powerup:banish"},". He also starts with ",{"i":"Sprite-Heart_of_Fire_(XIX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:heart-of-fire-xix"}," ",{"t":"Heart of Fire (XIX)","r":"weapon:heart-of-fire-xix"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["His Might increases depending on the missing proportion of his Max Health, with the formula Might*(1+((1−CurrentHealth/MaxHealth))*MaxHealth/180). Thus, missing health will increase Julius's Might more depending on his Max Health."]},{"k":"p","c":["Julius can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["To find Julius' coffin go to the end of the library where there is a red crack in the western wall."]},{"c":["Selecting the Arcana ",{"t":"Divine Bloodline (IX)","r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"}," pairs exceptionally well with Julius. The explosions triggered by Heart of Fire are considered retaliatory damage, which boosts his max health. Additionally, his passive ability to gain increased might as his health decreases synergizes perfectly with the effects of Divine Bloodline. Moreover, his starting weapon, the Vanitas Whip, scales with max health, which Divine Bloodline enhances, further amplifying its effectiveness."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Julius_Belmont.png","w":116,"h":120,"c":["Julius Belmont's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Julius_Belmont.gif","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 31 October 2024 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["His unlocking spell \"omniavanitas\" refers to one of the techniques that Julius uses in his home series."]},{"c":["The cross summoned by the ",{"t":"Aurablaster Tip","r":"weapon:aurablaster-tip"}," and ",{"t":"Aura Blast","r":"weapon:aura-blast"}," weapons is the version of ",{"t":"Grand Cross","r":"weapon:grand-cross"}," used by Julius in Aria of Sorrow and Dawn of Sorrow."]},{"c":["Him and ",{"t":"Leon","r":"character:leon-belmont"}," being the only unlockable characters through opening coffins before unlocking ",{"t":"Dracula","r":"character:vlad-tepes-dracula"}," is a reference to them being the first and last members of the Belmont Clan."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Julius Belmont","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Julius_Belmont"}," at the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}